{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_41","type":"agent_message","text":"The first complete automated campaign clears all eight waves and every boss phase using ordinary movement, firing, and brake actions. Two separate browser contexts have also completed a real PeerJS/WebRTC room test, including shared play and replay. Integration tests caught several issues—rendering context, retry audio, settings labels, and replay networking—which I’m correcting before the final checks.\n"}}
