rd-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022923/tools --diagnostic-level=error > Attack-of-the-Timelout-Attack-of-the-Timelord-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022923/test-artifacts/biome.log 2>&1\nruff check Attack-of-the-Timelout-Attack-of-the-Timelord-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022923/tests --fix > Attack-of-the-Timelout-Attack-of-the-Timelord-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022923/test-artifacts/ruff.log 2>&1\nruff format Attack-of-the-Timelout-Attack-of-the-Timelord-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022923/tests >> Attack-of-the-Timelout-Attack-of-the-Timelord-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022923/test-artifacts/ruff.log 2>&1\nnode Attack-of-the-Timelout-Attack-of-the-Timelord-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022923/tools/build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"Built Attack-of-the-Timelout-Attack-of-the-Timelord-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-022923.html (1431 KiB)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
